'''Gudebene Cat''' (ぐでベネにゃんこ) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Gudetama Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 7.1 Update|Version 7.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Gudebene Cat
|image = E 410.png
|appearance = [[Gudetama Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 500円 - 1,975円
}}

==Enemy==
Gudebene Cat seems very menacing at first, with its 420 range being even higher than [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic King Dragon]], and its Slow preventing most cats that don't outrange it from reaching it. Its damage is decent, but also nothing to worry about. It has no time between attacks, as well as a long foreswing and backswing, similar to Mooth. This means there won't be much trouble stalling it as long as you spam meatshields.

==Strategy==
[[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] is the key to this enemy. Bahamut has enough range to not need to worry about being hit, while also having the damage to almost two-shot it at level 20. Make sure to send out plenty of meatshields to keep your Bahamut safe, especially in the second level, where the other enemies can easily shred through [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|both]] [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|erasers!]]

